  },
  {
   "s": 14.98,
   "e": 19.42,
   "text": "small ones, every day. Go out or build, scroll or start, there was always a choice."
  },
  {
   "s": 19.92,
   "e": 25.84,
   "text": "His only job was to make it. Not every choice was right, his first company failed. He adjusted and"
